{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39939","headline":"义通里寓居即事 · 徐夤","name":"义通里寓居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家住寒梅翠岭东，长安时节咏途穷。\n牡丹窠小春余雨，杨柳丝疎夏足风。\n愁鬓已还年纪白，衰容宁藉酒杯红。\n长卿甚有凌云作，谁与清吟遶帝宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}